    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n1 Woodville Rise is a superb 4 bedroom Detached family home in a cul-de-sac setting, the property was constructed in 2003, has oil heating and measures approximately 124 sq. m. (1335 sq. ft.). The spacious accommodation includes, entrance hallway, living room, Kitchen/Dining Room and a downstairs wc. Upstairs there are four bedrooms (one ensuite) and a main bathroom.\nThis property provides very good off-street parking and has a spacious garden to the front and rear. \nThis fine home is situated in a 'sought after' residential area on the east side of Athlone and a short walk by footpath to all amenities and Athlone town centre. \nMinutes walk to Cornamaddy NS, Bus Stop, supermarkets, places of employment and easy access to M6 motorway.\nVIEWING HIGHLY RECOMMENDED AND BY APPOINTMENT:Agent: Liam QuainSHERRY FITZGERALD QUAIN"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Superb Location</li><li>Spacious Detached residence c.124sq.m</li><li>cul-de-sac setting</li><li>Oil Fired Central Heating with new burner.</li><li>Cobble lock front driveway and off street car parking </li><li>Spacious garden to the front and rear.</li><li>One minute walk from Cornamaddy NS and Bus Stop</li><li>Easy access to M6</li><li>South facing rear garden</ul>"
      },
      {
